{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p004a","title":"曹叡独见刘晔刘晔评其才具","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p004a-account","label":"裴注·世语","text":"曹叡独见刘晔刘晔评其才具","evidence":["mingdi-e-p004a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"召见","evidence":["mingdi-e-p004a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0071","role":"入见评说","evidence":["mingdi-e-p004a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":226,"label":"曹叡即位数日后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y226","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o001","basis":"曹叡即位数日后"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-p004a-q","mingdi-q-o001","mingdi-q-b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-p004a-q","source_order":[3,17,"P004a"],"order":706}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0071","name":"刘晔","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p004a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fe90f07dac235465da22","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《世语》曰：“帝与朝士素不接。即位之后，群下想闻风采。居数日，独见侍中刘晔。语尽日，众人侧听。晔既出，问：‘何如？’晔曰：‘秦始皇、汉孝武之俦，才具微不及耳。’”","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":16,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9ec711df2343b4a49a90","start":0,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗七年：黄初七年（公元226）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7290e2008f81d6cad349","start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o001","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fe69417d79b76e276a24","layer":"original","quote":"明皇帝讳叡，字元仲。文帝太子也。生而太祖爱之，常令在左右。﹝一﹞年十五，封武德侯。黄初二年为齐公。三年为平原王〖1〗。以其母诛，故未建为嗣。﹝二﹞七年夏五月〖2〗，帝病笃，乃立为皇太子。丁巳〖3〗，即皇帝位。大赦；尊皇太后曰太皇太后〖4〗，皇后曰皇太后〖5〗；诸臣封爵各有差。﹝三﹞〔六月〕，癸未〖6〗，追谥母甄夫人曰文昭皇后〖7〗。壬辰〖8〗，立皇弟蕤为阳平王〖9〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
